      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Calculation is not LLMs forte:**\n\nCorrect (expected)\n987654 × 123456 = 121,931,812,224\n\nLLM Output:\n987654 × 123456 = 121798355104\nwhich is INCORRECT!",
