        "content": "```\n                POST Request\n                     │\n                Webhook Trigger\n                     │\n             AI Agent (Assistant)\n                     │\n      ┌──────────────┼───────────────┐\n      │              │               │\nCalculator Tool   Weather Tool   Current Time Tool\n      │              │               │\n      └──────────────┼───────────────┘\n                     │\n             Respond to Webhook\n```",
        "height": 256,
